window.products.push({"id":713056,"name":"Formaticum Zero Cheese Storage Paper, Compostable, Biodegradable, and Plastic-Free Paper to Keep Cheese and Charcuterie Fresh, 9 x 13 Inches, 15 Total","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81l6lXgvijL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PLASTIC-FREE: Our Plastic-free Chees paper is compostable, biodegradable, & recyclable. This paper is sourced from sustainable forests. Our Zero Cheese storage paper will completely break down in less than 100 days. Ensure that your cheese maintains freshness and flavor for longer with a freshness extender that is plastic-free with a cellulose base coating from Formaticum that is porous and ideal for any cheese lover. EASY TO USE & VERSATILE - Keep your cheese fresh and delicious with our easy-to-use cheese storage papers. Used often for softer and fresh cheeses. Not only is it used for cheese and great for keeping fresh vegetables and fruits. Each package contains (15) fifteen sheets size 9\" x 13\" in size. SAVE YOUR CHEESE: There is nothing worse than seeing your brie, manchego, camembert or mozzarella dry out because you've used the wrong food storage bags. Our food saver sheets are the ideal cheese saver that are similar to a cheese cloths bags in that they let the cheese breath for prolonged freshness. KEEPS YOUR CHEESE FRESH: Unlike some paper bags or plastic wrap, the porous design of our cheese paper storage sheets allow your cheese to breathe while retaining ample humidity to keep moisture in, keep fresh, and prevent it from drying out. LET CHEESE BREATH: These non plastic sheets measures 9” x 13” so you can store just about any type of aged cheese. Whether you need to store an entire brick of cheddar, a smaller block of gruyere, these sheets will have you well prepared the next time you whip out the cheese boards!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81l6lXgvijL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Formaticum","source_asin":"B0C75ZV2G4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-713056","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C75ZV2G4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C75ZV2G4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":713057,"name":"Lavish Home Pregnancy Pillow- Full Body Maternity Pillow with Removable Cover and Contoured U-Shape Design for Back/Body Support Collection (Gray)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810PegGaJuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sleep peacefully throughout the night gently supported by the Lavish Home Collection Full Body Maternity Pillow. During pregnancy finding a comfortable sleeping arrangement can be a challenge. The Full Body Maternity Pillow with contoured u-shape helps alleviate discomfort by providing support to the unique shape of pregnancy with a unique contoured shape of its own. More than just a pillow for soon to be moms, the comfortable pillow is easily formed into multiple positions to provide support for reading, watching TV, or just relaxing. It even makes for a perfect nursing pillow to keep the baby elevated while mom’s back is still cushioned. For guided video instruction on how to fluff your pillow, view the “How to Fluff Your Full Body or Pregnancy Pillow” by Trademark Global on Youtube. FLUFFING INSTRUCTIONS: The pillow comes vacuum sealed for protection and to save you on shipping costs! Remove the pillow from the packaging and shake well a few times. Next, start at the bottom and rub each area of the pillow between your hands to loosen up the compressed stuffing, working your way around the entire pillow. Shake well again, then work your way around the pillow again \"fluffing\" each section as you go and shake one last time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810PegGaJuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lavish Home","source_asin":"B0B7ZYYZWF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-713057","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7ZYYZWF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7ZYYZWF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
