window.products.push({"id":713285,"name":"ecoKiwi Cedar Blocks for Clothes Storage - 75 Pack Cedar Balls - Natural Oil Hanger Planks & Chips for Closets - Non Toxic Cedarwood Balls with Sandpa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718wLy3d21L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"😁NO MORE HOLES IN CLOTHES - We've all had that sinking feeling when we try on our favourite item of clothing, only to see it full of holes. Protect your clothes the natural way with our sustainable cedar balls. We've designed our cedar chips for closets and drawers to incrementally release essential oils. Instead of using low grade plastic, our balls can last years, simply sand the surface to keep the cedar scented essential oils flowing. 🌎PROTECT OUR PRECIOUS PLANET - At ecoKiwi, we were tired of seeing excess waste and unsustainable products, so we created our cedar balls for clothes storage to be long-lasting and sustainably sourced. Our cedar for clothes storage eliminates the need for any chemicals or plastics to be used. Just pure, sustainable natural wooden cedar balls. Join the eco friendly revolution with our cedar planks for closets. 👃A REFRESHING & SENSATIONAL SCENT - Cedar has a light, reinvigorating and delicate fragrance. Our cedar wood balls for closets are specially selected at the source to ensure it's packed with essential oils. Whether in your wardrobe, drawer liners or cupboard, our cedar for closets will illuminate the atmosphere with a cosseting cloud of cedar to ensure holes in your clothes, odors and excess moisture in your wardrobe are distant memories. 🌲HARNESS THE POWER OF NATURE - Made from eastern red cedar wood that diminishes mustiness and moisture. Our cedar closet fresheners also reduce odor and provides a fresh scent. The delicate oil within our cedar balls possesses a natural herbal quality for the perfect cedar closet freshener. Every 3 months, just give our cedar for closets and drawers a light sand with the sandpaper provided to ensure it remains effective. ✅MULTIPURPOSE & VERSATILE - Our cedar balls can be placed in drawers, closet shelves, on your hangers or anywhere else. As our balls are 100% natural they can touch any fabric directly and won't stain or emit any smell on clothes. Our cedar blocks for closets also reduce mustiness, absorb excess moisture and keep your wardrobe smelling delectably fresh. Simply put into the cotton bag sachets provided for the best experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718wLy3d21L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ecoKiwi","source_asin":"B0BJ2RGXJK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-713285","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJ2RGXJK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJ2RGXJK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
