window.products.push({"id":713321,"name":"YICCU Boning Knife for Meat Cutting, Hand Forged Meat Cleaver Knife with Sheath & Pocket Knife Sharpener, Chef Knives Fishing Skinning Filet Viking Kn","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718gz2FQefS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The YICCU Hand Forged Boning Knife adoptes integrated design, instead of welding the blade and handle. Durable and longer service life. Multi-purpose boning knife ✓The curved blade is perfect for many kitchen tasks like slicing, dicing and mincing vegetables, fruits and meat, chopping beef, deboning a whole chicken and lamb leg, filleting fish, peeling the skin, separate the ribs from the pork loin etc. ✓It's a good choice for kitchen, camping, BBQ, barbecue, hunting or hiking. It's a great gifts for a chef! Unique Design ✓Unique hand forged texture on the blade helps to prevent foods from sticking.  ✓Ergonomic curved full tang wooden handle and large finger hole on the blade provides a good balance and a secure grip for excellent control, you will not feel tired for using long time. Specification: ✓Knife weight: 252g / 0.55lb ✓Knife length: 10.82 Inch (275 mm) ✓Blade length: 5.7 Inch (145 mm) ✓Blade thickness: 0.15 Inch (4 mm) ✓Blade material: 5cr15mov Stainless Steel ✓Handle Material: Full Tang integrated steel shank + wood + rivet fixing ✓Sheath Material: Leather ✓Sharpener Material: Plastic+diamond+ceramic  ✓Perfect Assistant in Home Cooking, Camping, Barbecue, Hunting. Package Includes: 1* Boning Knife 1* Leather Sheath 1* Tiny Sharpener 1* Exquisite packaging box Maintenance Method ✓Please keep it clean and dry to resist rust after use. ✓Acidic or alkaline substances cannot be left on the knife for a long time.  ✓If you don't use it for a long time, you can coat some cooking oil on it, and should be stored in a dry place.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718gz2FQefS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YICCU","source_asin":"B092MM3XTT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-713321","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092MM3XTT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092MM3XTT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":713322,"name":"T-fal Enameled Cast Iron Round Dutch Oven with Lid, 6 quart, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":60.07,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S6QQ75AkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Achieve tender results and maximum ﬂavors with the T-fal Enameled Cast Iron 6 Quart Dutch Oven. As beautiful as it is durable, you can take it from stove to oven to table seamlessly or even display it on your stovetop for a pop of color. Built for versatility, its deep sides and wide, ﬂat base are ideal for braising a whole chicken, simmering a hearty stew, or even baking bread. Featuring a unique, tight-ﬁtting condensation lid, it redistributes moisture uniformly throughout your food for unvarying results. Its multilayer enamel coating ensures durability, and the cast iron core retains and evenly distributes heat. Sturdy loop handles facilitate maneuverability and the stainless steel knob makes it oven safe up to 500ºF. Compatible with all stove tops, including induction, it’s backed by a limited lifetime warranty. Hand wash only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S6QQ75AkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"T-fal","source_asin":"B09WW76GK9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-713322","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WW76GK9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WW76GK9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":713323,"name":"Amish Handcrafted Solid Pine Bread Box.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jPuQRTslL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Amish Handcrafted Solid Pine Bread Box. Handcrafted By the Old Order Amish Craftmen Locally in the Heart of Ohio. This Bread Box Has Been Sanded to a Fine Finish and Is Ready to Be Painted or Stained to Match Your Decor. Solid Unfinished Pine Bread Box Has a Slanted Top Door with a Hand Painted Blue Cutout of Two Little Amish Girls Wearing One Blue and One Red Dress As Well As Bonnets, Each Holding Steaming Fresh Bread and Sitting in the Green Grass. The Top of the Bin Lifts up and Is the Perfect Place to Store Your Bread, Cookies, Danishes, or Other Snacks. This Is a Beautiful Solution to Organize Your Kitchen At the Same Time While Giving Your Kitchen a Warm Country Feel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jPuQRTslL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMISH WARES","source_asin":"B00N9BZLOM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-713323","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00N9BZLOM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00N9BZLOM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
