window.products.push({"id":713331,"name":"Itvgekp Gifts for Mom, Mom Gifts for Mothers Day Birthday Valentines Day, Blanket Gifts for Mom Women from Daughter Son Soft Warm Throw Blanket 50\" x ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Yq1bF-wvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Gifts for Best Mom: Give this special gift blanket to the best mom in the world, and let mom feel the deepest love from her sons or daughters! The unique mom gift blanket is personalized with all the words we want say to our mother's every day to thank she for all that she do. When mom opens this blanket gift, she will know that you love her and she will be very touched and happy! Warm Hug for Mom: Our mom blankets are made of 100% flannel, the premium fabrics undergo strict quality control. Even after washing, it will still not change it's lightweight, cozy, fluffy, and soft. When your mom uses these blankets, it's like you're giving her a warm hug and telling her I love you mom! Love for Mom Every Moment: Our mothers gave us life, so we should be grateful and love mom every time. This throw blanket for women, is a good gift to celebrate your mom for Mother's Day, Birthday, Valentine's Day, Anniversary, Thanksgiving, Christmas, or any time of the year. You can give these blankets to your mom whenever you want to show your love for her. Let Mom Feel Love Everywhere: These mom blanket size 50\" x 60\", the perfect size for every season. Mom can use this blanket on bed, sofa, chairs, office, indoor, also be used outdoors, such as car, airplanes, camping, travel etc. Let mom feel your love for her at home or out. Our Most Sincere Service: We serve every customer seriously, we have a professional team to create a gift of love for the loved one, customer satisfaction always comes first. If you encounter any problems in the process of use, please contact us in time, we will promptly solve for you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Yq1bF-wvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Itvgekp","source_asin":"B0BW3QBVNY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-713331","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BW3QBVNY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BW3QBVNY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":713332,"name":"RT Designers Collection Hannah 3-Piece Reversible Quilt Set-Queen, Purple/Teal/Navy/Green/Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1679-mPNwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add elegance to any bedroom with this 3-Piece Reversible Quilt Set by RT Designers Collection. This 3-Piece Reversible Quilt Set features a reversible design that showcases a stylish top and reverse providing two gorgeous looks in one. Quilted with bright hues incorporated with neutral tones this quilt set is fun yet sophisticated. Crafted from high quality microfiber the quilt set is soft to the touch and easy to care for for years of vibrant color.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1679-mPNwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RT Designers Collection","source_asin":"B07GJ1K7VY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-713332","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GJ1K7VY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GJ1K7VY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":713333,"name":"City to Cottage® Teal Blue And White Polka Dot Handmade Ceramic Teapot for two","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XKyCy2TgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Simple but impressive reasons to buy this product: Our quirky teapots can be used as a loose leaf tea pot or just pop the bag in and leave it to brew. Holding 750ml of tea this funky teapot is the perfect size for any occasion. Designed to pour tea the way it deserves with a good pourer and being a teapot that doesn’t drip makes this a perfect addition to your daily tea routine, so cosy up and enjoy your tea from that beautiful teapot. The teapot has been around since the mid 1300’s making it a vintage classic which we still use in this modern day. It could be a teapot for one, teapot for two or a teapot for four there are many designs of the classic tea pot but our vibrant colours and polka dots make this the perfect teapot gift set. So why not add some polka dot mugs and polka dot milk jug to make it a polka dot tea set which everyone will love! Maybe place some polka dot dinnerware on the table too. Our polka dot dinnerware family and other polka dot crockeries are unique gifts for all tastes. So why not treat a loved one to a unique teapot or even a full tea set with our teapot and cups in the polka dot design. Helping save the environment one sugar bowl at a time all our ceramic sugar bowls are made using solar power, enabling you to have a decorative sugar bowl which you can leave on your breakfast table. Save time on the washing up with this spotty tea pot by putting it in the dishwasher when it’s time to clean, no matter the blend this ceramic teapot will not absorb odours or flavours and it is dishwasher and microwave safe!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XKyCy2TgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"City to Cottage","source_asin":"B07J5QVGVW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-713333","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07J5QVGVW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07J5QVGVW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":713334,"name":"Crandek Boho Jute Hanging Basket - Wicker Hanging Fruit Basket for Fresh Produce Storage, Vegetable Keeper for Potato, Onion Garlic, Plant Holder - Ha","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bP1lbq06L._AC_.jpg","description":"What's your storage situation in your home and office? How you organize objects in your home can impact the overall aesthetic and feel of your space. And yet we oftentimes pay no mind to the storage solutions we use. Boxes, crates, and closets may be functional but they can be pretty uninteresting and bland to look at. If you agree and think it's time for a unique change, we've got what you're looking for. The Crandek Jute Hanging Basket will make storage both fun and functional. These hanging organizers are perfect for people who are looking for ways to tidy up their space without sacrificing visual style and aesthetic. They come in a charming bohemian style which can compliment any kitchen, bedroom, living room, patio, and virtually any space. They are roomy enough to store produce, spices, ingredients, decorative plants, and more. Made of heavy duty jute fibers, these bags won't break or snap even when filled to the brim with your favorite food. Jute is well known for being strong and is commonly used for handwoven bags. This material is also breathable which is important to keep fruits and vegetables fresh and properly ventilated. Got no time to sit down for breakfast on weekdays? No problem, just grab into the bag for a piece of fruit and go. The wide opening gives you convenient access to the contents, there's no need to open locks, zippers, or clasps. It also makes cooking a lot easier because you can easily see what's inside. The jute baskets are easy to use and come with holes for you to conveniently attach to hooks or poles. More reasons to love these jute hanging organizers: - Breathable storage for fruits and vegetables - Made of premium jute fibers - Sturdy and roomy - Easy to use and mount Make kitchen organization seamless and stylish! Add the Crandek Jute Hanging Basket to your cart NOW!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bP1lbq06L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CRANDEK","source_asin":"B0B6Q7JBKV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-713334","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6Q7JBKV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6Q7JBKV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
