window.products.push({"id":713498,"name":"Set of 2, 5, 7, and More Custom Personalized Pink Flasks for Bride, Bridesmaid - Engraved Bachelorette Party Gifts - Passion Style (8)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-Rha3KP1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FREE ENGRAVING - Customize with names, wedding roles and a date. And the price per flask automatically discounts the more you buy. Buy the flask only or choose the gift box option and it will come with a funnel, 4 shot glasses and a presentation box. SIZE - Holds 6oz of your favorite spirit and comes beautifully engraved in silver on your pink matte flask GREAT GIFT - Perfect for the bachelorette party or wedding day for the entire party. The bride, bridesmaid, maid of honor, and matron of honor can all have their own personal flasks 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED - Contact us and let us know if you have any questions or concerns - Your satisfaction is our TOP priority!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-Rha3KP1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"My Personal Memories","source_asin":"B07GR8JSC4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-713498","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GR8JSC4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GR8JSC4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":713499,"name":"EnviroSupply Premium 4mm Pellet Virgin Bituminous Coal Activated Carbon Charcoal (for Air Purification, Odor Control, Vapor Phase Applications) - Bulk","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":53.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jCI2wF9CL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"EnviroSupply & Service's 4mm Virgin Bituminous Coal is an activated carbon that is suitable for the removal of a wide range of organic pollutants in the vapour phase. The predominance of micropores ensures effective removal of low molecular weight contaminants. The extruded form of this product offers exceptional durability, especially in annular and deep bed adsorption units where thermal stress may be high. 4mm Virgin Bituminous Coal is suitable for use in inert gas purification, for example carbon dioxide and nitrogen, and recovery of low boiling point solvents. FEATURES AND BENEFITS: • High activity product  • Extruded form  • Predominately microporous  • Exceptional product hardness  • Low dust forming properties  • Good resistance to attrition  • Wide range of pellet diameters  • High organic removal capacity  • Versatile adsorbent  • Consistent pressure loss characteristics SPECIFICATION:  CTC adsorption min. 60%  • Moisture content, as packed max. 5%  • Ash content max. 15%  • Hardness min. 98% TYPICAL PROPERTIES:  • Surface area 1050m2/g  • Butane adsorption 26% • Apparent density, tapped 460  • 520 kg/m3 Filling density, loose packed 390  • 440 kg/m3  • Pellet diameter tolerance ±10% dia.  • Specific heat 950 j/Kg/oK-1 If you have any questions about this product or any of the other products we offer, ask us anytime! Our team at EnviroSupply is always here to assist with your purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jCI2wF9CL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EnviroSupply","source_asin":"B07YH15W8L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-713499","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YH15W8L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YH15W8L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
