window.products.push({"id":713503,"name":"ZzPro Commercial 4 Channels Kitchen Timers Restaurant Timer Loud Alarm Adjustable Cooking Reminder Stainless Steel Clear Led Display for Multiple Even","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QwkRSMfyL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This digital kitchen timer is appropriate for the home kitchen and business restaurant which would facilitate your cooking and prevent your food from overcooking. It has an accurate and convenient system, what you need to do is set the time and start cooking. It can also be applied for other situation. Feature: -this is a 4 channel timer, each time window can be set independently at the same time for different cooking procedures.  -this timer have 0000-99.59 minutes mode and 0000-99.59 hours mode. There are 3 stages of reminder for each time window.  -High decibel buzzer alarm designed for busy kitchen. You even could hear the sound of the timer from other room, the volume is adjustable and automatically recorded.  -The timer is made of stainless steel which is easy to clean and maintain.  -The timer can be hung on the wall for saving space. Operation: \"TIME\" : Set the total cooking time. the alarm will start ringing when the time ends.  \"REMINDER\" : You can adjust the reminder before cooking. If there is no need for reminder, you can set the time to 00:00  \"DECREASE\" : Decrease time digit or volume.  \"INCREASE\" : Increase time digit or volume.  \"NUMBER KEY\" : Start or stop the time. Specifications voltage: AC 100v to 240v  Power consumption: 3W  Power cable: 1.5m/59inch with US plug. Product size: 6.7*5.1*1.57inch  Product weight: 1.54lb   What's in the box  1x Digital Kitchen Timer 1x operation insturction Caution: 1.DO NOT wash the timer with water! You can wipe the timer with a damp cloth, turn the power off before cleaning.  2.DO NOT touch the control board with any hard object in order not to damage the surface and button  3.DO NOT attempt to disassemble the machine so as to avoid getting electrical shock.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QwkRSMfyL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZzPro","source_asin":"B07B9R59QG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-713503","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B9R59QG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B9R59QG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":713504,"name":"National Tree 70 Bulb Indoor/Outdoor Dual LED Starter Light Set with 5-Function Foot Pedal and Transformer (LS11-801-70)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91KnpkmDXWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dual Color lights change from soft white to multicolor with the press of a button! This STARTER SET includes one light string with 70 low voltage LED lights, transformer and foot pedal to control light actions. These energy-efficient, long lasting LED bulbs feature 5 functions which operate by pressing the foot pedal: steady soft white; steady multicolor; fading soft white, fading soft white to multicolor; lights off. String can be lengthened by connecting ADD-ON strings, model # LS11-802-70 (sold separately). Light string features BULB-LOCK to keep bulbs from falling out. Indoor use only. Includes spare bulbs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91KnpkmDXWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"National Tree Company","source_asin":"B00EJ2E7IQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-713504","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EJ2E7IQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EJ2E7IQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
