window.products.push({"id":713661,"name":"Honey-Can-Do 1158 Pierogi Maker, 11.6 x 3.8 x 1 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Y0pmcjF3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Honey-Can-Do 1158 pierogi maker, 16H x 6W. Soft non-scratch, non-slip feet. Made in USA. Makes 6 crescent shaped pierogi or ravioli. Honey-Can-Do 1158 pierogi maker, silver. Make six crescent-shaped pierogi or ravioli at once with our handy pierogi maker. To use, place a sheet of pasta dough over the form and gently use your thumb to make indentations. Fill pockets with your desired filling and brush edges with water or beaten egg. Place a second sheet of pasta dough over the form and roll a straight rolling pin across the form using pressure so it will seal and cut the pierogi or ravioli. Includes non-slip, non-scratch feet. Wipe clean. Do not wash with soap or in dishwasher. . Honey-Can-Do was founded on a few simple principles, give people what they want, give it to them at a great price, and do it with integrity and responsibility. We don't believe you need to go broke to have a beautiful, well-organized home. Nor do we believe that the environment or our people should suffer for our desire for great Product, which is why we operate an Ethical and eco-responsible company that brings sustainable materials and processes into our business every day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Y0pmcjF3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Honey-Can-Do","source_asin":"B00188DL6S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-713661","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00188DL6S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00188DL6S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":713662,"name":"Aukfa Electric Heated Blanket Throw, 50” x 60” Soft Flannel Electric Blanket, 10 Heat Levels & 10 Hours Timer Auto Off, Fast Heating Blanket for Home ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r2y6R9GwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Flannel WARM & COZY PLUS LUXURIOUSLY SOFT: Aukfa heated blanket heats up in seconds and reaches intense heat levels without getting uncomfortably warm. The premium elongated heating wire of heated throw blanket provides even heat distribution and a quick consistent flow of supplementary heat and protects you from the chilly weather. Crafted with soft and cozy flannel, this heated blanket throw measures 50 inch by 60 inch to keep your full body warm or heat your bed before going to sleep. 10 HEAT SETTINGS & 1-10 HOURS TIMERS, 3 HOURS AUTO SHUT-OFF: Choose your desired warmth with the attached easy-to-use digital backlit LCD controller from the electric blanket throw. The temperature ranges from 68-131°F and you can select up to 10 different heating levels and 10 timer settings (1 - 10 hours) that will provide you the customized warmth and ensure you will be covered softly, safely and comfortably. The electric blankets automatically shut off after 3 hours of use. CONVENIENCE & EASE OF USE: The ETL-certified heating blanket with built-in overheating protection system senses and adjusts heat throughout the blanket to bring you consistent, cozy heat. 10 feet extra-long power cable allows the heated blanket full size to be used flexibly whether in your bedroom, couch, office, RV, or air mattress. You can also convert it into a regular blanket by simply removing the controller, providing you the ability to use it as a normal plush blanket or a warm blanket. MACHINE WASHABLE & DRYER SAFE: The large cozy electric throw blanket is machine washable, simply detach the controller and toss into the washer and set the settings to cold water and gentle wash, so you don’t need to worry about dirt stains or odors. For better performance, wash separately in cold water, tumble dry low or air dry. Gently stretch the heat blanket to its original size and connect the controller and ready to go for another heat session. 5 YEAR LIMITED WARRANTY: At Aukfa, we value our customers and want to ensure every customer has a great experience. We provide 24/7 customer service and peace of mind to millions worldwide all from a brand you can trust, our team speak both English and Spanish if you need any assistance. All our heated throw blanket electric blankets are ETL certified and RoHS Compliant. Moreover, we offer our customers a 5-year limited warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r2y6R9GwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aukfa","source_asin":"B0BPG4MX95","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-713662","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPG4MX95","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPG4MX95","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
