window.products.push({"id":713680,"name":"Rechargeable Electric Salt and Pepper Grinder Set,2 Automatic Salt and Pepper Grinder Set,Adjustable Coarseness Salt&Pepper Shakers with Charging Base","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xpKd7xMEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"USB BASE RECHARGEABLE GRINDER: The salt and pepper grinding unit is rechargeable. Type-C charging base can be charged by placing the grinder on the charging base. It can be used to store two pepper and pepper grinders, both for charging and storage, making your kitchen clean and tidy, and providing you with the greatest convenience. Only one USB charging cable is needed, and there is no need to waste a lot of money on the battery. HIGH QUALITY ABS MATERIAL: rechargeable salt and pepper mill are made of food grade ABS material, without BPA-FREE, heat insulation and wear resistance, and the matte surface is fine. The container with a capacity of 70 ml is designed with a clear lid, which can easily distinguish spices and condiments without confusion. There is no need to disassemble the main body, which is convenient for filling, and you can easily monitor when spices need to be refilled. It is an ideal choice for kitchens, outdoor barbecues and restaurants. ADJUSTABLE ROUGHNESS: powerful grinding force and upgraded ceramic core provide first-class grinding speed and quality. Just turn the knob at the bottom of the electric salt and pepper grinder to set the required roughness. Rotate the fine powder clockwise and the coarse particle counterclockwise, so you can freely choose the required particle size, which is applicable to most solid spices. Sea salt, black pepper, white pepper and other spices, ONE HAND OPERATION AND LED LIGHT: Just press and hold the button of the automatic salt and pepper grinder, you can grind fresh spices with one hand. Compared with the manual grinder, it frees your hands to do other things, and immediately stops working when the button is released, so you can easily control the dosage. When the electric pepper grinder is working or charging, the blue LED lights up automatically, allowing you to use it intuitively. WIDELY USED: This electric salt and pepper grinder can grind various spices effortlessly, such as Himalayan salt, sea salt, white pepper and black pepper, black sesame and Sichuan pepper, Himalayan salt, red pepper slices, rosemary, star anise, flaxseed and cumin seed. It is very suitable for kitchens, outdoor barbecues and restaurants, with brushes, funnels, wooden spoons, and no need to purchase other accessories","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xpKd7xMEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KAEPTSAV","source_asin":"B0BRN86ZYX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-713680","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRN86ZYX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRN86ZYX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
