window.products.push({"id":713785,"name":"BizChair Geometric 6' x 9' Blue and Gray Olefin Area Rug with Jute Backing, Living Room, Bedroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":103.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91tnV0jUsEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stunning geometric shapes and beautiful colors marry seamlessly in this trendy floor covering. This contemporary accent rug makes a statement and will add texture and depth to any room in your home. Modern area rugs provide many benefits in today's modern homes. Use this striking piece to add warmth to hardwood floors, color in multiple spaces, and protect your flooring in high-traffic areas. Modern materials allow this area rug to stand up to the rigors of everyday life. Made from olefin fibers, this cutting edge area rug is stain and water resistant, colorfast, and provides a soft underfoot feel friendly to kids and pets. The jute backing gives this rug structural integrity and helps promote air flow. Vacuum regularly without the beater bar and spot clean with water and a mild detergent to maintain the look of your new rug.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91tnV0jUsEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BizChair","source_asin":"B0BGJJY7N5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-713785","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGJJY7N5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGJJY7N5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":713786,"name":"Devo Clothes Drying Rack, Large 4-Tier Folding Laundry Rack, Adjustable Rolling Garment Rack, Clothes Dryer for Bed Linen, Clothing, Socks, Double H D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ssLGsQkkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Large Capacity: 4-TIER oversized clothes drying rack, The expanded size are 150.5x22x178.5cm/59x8.6x70 inch(LxWxH). Duble H design, full expanded With 12 retractable trays (with 24 pillars), 2 side wings(with extral 14 hooks), and one bottom shelf. Meeting your large drying demand. Multifunction Design: Designed for indoor and outdoor use. not only as a laundry drying rack, but also can be used in bedroom or loft to storage your garments, even can be folded and placed on the balcony, patio and corner save you space. Sturdy and Durable: The drying rack is made of high-hardness stainless steel and thick plastic,Thicken steel tubes provides sturdiness and strong bearing capacity,One retractable can hold 5KG/11LBS and one pillars can hold 0.5kg/1.2lbs, so that you can store more clothes. Removable & Collapsible: Made of 4 casters, it can 360 degrees freely rotate, which enables you move this drying rack effortlessly no matter where you want to place it. Floding size:83.5x22x178.5cm/33x8.6x70inch(LxWxH),You can just put it in any corner or use this rack as a Clothing Garment Rack store clothes. Easy Assembly: With assembly tools and illustrations, easy to put together. Easy fold and Lightweight for moving.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ssLGsQkkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Devo","source_asin":"B0B1V5BV7X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-713786","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1V5BV7X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1V5BV7X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
