window.products.push({"id":713832,"name":"200pcs Disposable Icing Piping Bags - 12 Inch Pastry Bag Frosting Bags for Cake Cookies Baking Decorating - Plastic Tipless Piping Bags","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.29,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YcouDSM4L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"ANTI-BREAK: Our piping bags are made of durable food-grade plastic with a non-slip textured surface for a better grip, the icing piping bag with thickened anti-crack material is strong enough to withstand the pressure from squeezing and frosting. Don't worry about the plastic bag breaking easily LARGE CAPACITY AND WIDE OPENING: Our pastry bag measure 12*8 inches perfect for making enough pastry snacks for an entire party or tea time, the large opening clear plastic bag makes filling easy MULTI-FUNCTIONAL DECORATION: These piping bags can be used for cream cookie decorating, birthday wedding cakes, pastries, chocolate decorating, macarons, cake frosting, holiday desserts, sauces and adding decorative nice pattern details like stars and flowers to your baking desserts FITS ALL SIZES OF PIPE FITTINGS: You just need to cut the tip of the tube bag according to the size of the fitting, place the fitting in the bag, insert the piping bag and you're ready to decorate your dessert. Our piping bags fit perfectly no matter what size your coupler is, and you can also use it without the tip or coupler SAFE AND EASY TO CLEAN: The tipless cream bag is made of food-grade material, safe and non-toxic, 200 pieces of disposable piping bags are cost-effective, can be thrown away after use, no need to clean, save your time","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YcouDSM4L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOTOOSE","source_asin":"B0B4WL9RWM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-713832","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4WL9RWM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4WL9RWM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":713833,"name":"COSTWAY Tower Fan, 14 Inches Portable Oscillating Desk Fan with 3 Speeds, Quiet Operation, 4H Timer Function, Personal Standing Fan Perfect for Bedsid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pea+IzI-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💨【3 Wind Speeds & Timer Function】The tower fan provides you with 3 wind speeds for choice and the instruction light will show you the current speed, which is convenient for you to easily adjust to satisfy your different cooling needs. Besides,1/2/4H timer function allows you to choose suitable working time, especially when taking a nap or sleeping. 💨【Wide-angle Oscillation】The tower fan can rotate from side to side with a range of 0-90 degrees, which can distribute airflow to wherever you need. And constant wiggling up and down accelerates air circulation to cool your entire room in no time. 💨【Quiet Operation & Soft Breeze】With gentle and soft wind, this powerful tower fan has been professionally designed to produce very little noise (no more than 55dB), providing you a comfortable and silent environment for reading, watching TV or sleeping. 💨【Safe & Stable Construction】Designed with tiny grid, the bladeless tower fan keeps children from sticking their fingers in, which makes it much safer for families with children to use. Also, the fan employs overload protection (fuse) to prevent damage from over voltage and surges. Moreover, the base together with the anti-slip pads ensures the overall stability when in operation. 💨【Compact Size & Easy Carrying】Due to its space-saving compact design, the tower fan will be really suitable for bedroom, kitchen, office, RV, etc. without taking up too much space. And it comes with a convenient built-in handle for easy transportation, which is ideal for you to take it between rooms at home or office.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pea+IzI-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COSTWAY","source_asin":"B09FFHRSV4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-713833","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FFHRSV4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FFHRSV4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
