window.products.push({"id":713964,"name":"ExclusiveLane Spice Box with Floral Burnt Design in Sheeham Wood - Spice Rack Spice Holders Masala Container","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61reQ0emboL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Skilfully handcrafted in terracotta and handpainted with delicate details by artisans from the interiors of India, ‘Warli In Light’ is a beautifully round potshaped lampshade that also doubles up as an ethnic table top accessory. Inspired from the indigenous art of the Warli tribe, the Base of this lamp has been hand embellished with their rustic paintings in miniature patches of tribal scenes that bring in the mood of celebration and happiness. The rich crimson red on the lamp Base with a beautiful pastel blue neck and yellow rim and it’s artistic form of a tapered round body and flat Base is complemented magically with an offwhite polyvinyl wrapped cotton shade decorated in multiple detailed hand painted bright coloured patterns. Features: Perfect to be put up in a living room or bedroom to add an ethnic touch to your home. Can also be used as an artistic table top accessory. Handembellished with miniature patches of Warli painting depicting tribal scenes. The lamp has been handcrafted in terracotta while the shade has been handmade in cotton cloth wrapped over polyvinyl. Handpainted in crimson red and pastel blue. Comes in the following Dimensions: Total 10.2 inch (H), shade is 4.8 inch (H), 6.1 inch (dia), Base is 7.1 inch (H), 5.1 inch (dia) in size. It will definitely add a striking vibrant glow to the interiors of your home. Art Type: Warli handpainting. Note: The bulb and the holder type B22. The plug type is 2 pin plug. Bulb is not included. Comes without an on or off switch. Photoframe and pen shown in the image are not included with this lamp. As this product is handcrafted there might be a slight Color or design variation, which is natural and hence makes the product unique. It consists of 1 shade and 1 Base.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61reQ0emboL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ExclusiveLane","source_asin":"B01JGLYLFS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-713964","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01JGLYLFS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01JGLYLFS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
